  "description": "Perfect for when you’re thinking, “I want a quick dose of mystery!”\nEach puzzle is a simple one-question, one-answer challenge.\n\nYou’ll face strange little moments hidden in everyday life—\nodd details and puzzling events that make you tilt your head.\n\nRead the story, sort out the situation, and reach the one true answer.\n\nControls are simple:\nWhen you’ve got it, just tap the part you think is the answer.\n\nThat “Aha!” moment is addictive.\nUse your observation and imagination to unravel every mystery!",
